{title: Amar Mallika Bone}
{artist: Paroma Dasgupta}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
Jokhon [A] prothom dhoreche koli,        Amar [Dm] Mollika [A] Bone
[A] Tomari lagiya [E] tokhoni bondhu,        Bedhechinu [A] anjoli
Amar [E] Mallika [A] Bone,        Amar [Dm] Mallika [A] Bone
Jokhon [A] prothom dhoreche [A] koli,        Amar [Dm] Mollika [A] Bone
[A] Tokhono kuheli-jaale,        [E] Sokha toruni ushar bhaley
[E] Sishire sishire [A] aruno-malika,        [E] Uthiteche cholo- [A] choli
Amar [E] Mollika [A] Bone,        Amar [Dm] Mallika [A] Bone
Jokhon [A] prothom dhoreche [A] koli,        Amar [Dm] Mollika [A] Bone
[Dm] Ekhono bonero [A] gaan,        [Dm] Bondhu hoyni to [A] oboshan
Tobu [G] ekhoni jabe ki [A] cholei,        [Dm] Ekhono bonero [A] gaan
[Dm] Bondhu hoyni to [A] oboshan,        Tobu [G] ekhoni jabe ki [A] cholei [G] .. [A]
[A] O mor koruno [D] bollika,        [E] O tor shranto mollika
[E] Jhoro jhoro holo,        [A] Ei bela tor [E] sesh kotha dish [A] boli
Amar [E] Mollika [A] Bone,        Amar [Dm] Mallika [A] Bone
Jokhon [A] prothom dhoreche koli,        Amar [Dm] Mollicka [A] Bone
